# Autonomous Trading System - Core Rules
#
# Legacy stub for tools that only read `.cursorrules`. Canonical copy:
# `.cursor/rules/00-core.mdc` (alwaysApply). Do not treat this file as a
# second rule set.

## Authority

`docs/context/` is canonical. Deterministic code owns every live decision.

`docs/research/` is superseded history (provenance only). Never implement from
it.

File-scoped agent rules live under `.cursor/rules/` (`10-` through `70-`, plus
`01-planning-context.mdc` and `05-sq.mdc`).

`SQ` in a user prompt: `.cursor/rules/05-sq.mdc`.
